<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Thursday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities vary slightly.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p> BPI		     11.125/11.00   11.55 /11.425  12.125/11.95</p>
<p> Citibank		11.00 /10.875  11.75 /11.50   12.20 /12.00</p>
<p> Metrobank	     11.20 /11.00   11.70 /11.50   11.95 /11.75</p>
<p> Multinational	 11.25 /11.00   11.65 /11.30   12.125/11.80</p>
<p> PNB		     10.925/10.85   11.50 /11.40   11.95 /11.85</p>
<p> StandChart Bank     11.15 /10.90   11.65 /11.40   12.15 /11.90</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8937</p>
